Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,MENDAKI is introducing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ready for School
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,e-voucher initiative
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,which we hope to help kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,from Primary One
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,all the way up to university.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This year, MENDAKI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,is giving out $250 e-vouchers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents can use
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.12,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,for their children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it's schoolbooks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it is stationery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,or even shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, as we begin the school year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,for many parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,it's also a time where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,there are a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,expenses for school
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and we want our kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to have the best start in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And during these times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when you have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,cost of living concerns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,challenging times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,we want to help parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,from low-income families
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,to support their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's important because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,especially for parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,who have more than one child
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,sometimes you have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,two or three kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's always challenging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to try to fork out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.38,0:00:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that much expense at one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We are pegging it at about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,$1,000 per capita income
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.02,0:00:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So we expect more than
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,22,000 students
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,who could benefit from this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and this is in addition to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.74,0:00:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,about 13,000 others
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that typically benefit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,from our TTFS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and other MENDAKI schemes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.14,0:00:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's an application basis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and we start to take
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.70,0:00:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,applications from 1st December.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.04,0:00:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So we hope that this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,will do its part
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to help parents and children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,have a good start for the year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.86,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and not to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,about some of these expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.76,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,that would have otherwise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.56,0:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,held them back.
